{
  "protocol": "structured_challenge_v1",
  "control": "local frozen regression challenge on a typed resolver; designed separately from the implementation and visible to the same project; neither a sealed holdout nor a natural-language trial",
  "grading": {
    "scope": "Score all 30 actions. Eligible numeric answers also require the selected metric, financial cutoff, expected native unit, source SHA-256, vetted SQL text, a nonempty caveat, and all specified independent support fields. Empty numeric responses must contain a reason and no numeric payload. Coverage includes every preregistered answerable case, including holds. Separately count permitted components returned for mixed requests. A whole-request hold counts only as containment.",
    "tolerance": "Exact integers. Fractions within 1e-12 absolute of the ratio of frozen numerator and denominator. Presence of free text is only an observability check; review disclosure meaning separately."
  },
  "oracle": "Raw loan rows; each qualifying account is found by a distinct transaction event in the same frozen snapshot. Grouped statuses A/B/C/D determine counts and approved amounts. Scheduled activity requires origination <= cutoff < maturity, with SQLite month overflow reproduced using calendar arithmetic. No candidate SQL or result was used in label generation.",
